# ----- [SHEPHERD] ------
# .artifacts/ is scratch + FABLE's toolkit. Sprint report DELIVERABLES belong in
# .shepherd/runs/{run}/reports/ (not ignored); durable ones in .shepherd/docs/reports/.
**/.artifacts/backups/
**/.artifacts/cache/
**/.artifacts/reports/
**/.artifacts/temp/

**/.shepherd/backups/
**/.shepherd/cache/
**/.shepherd/runs/*/.run.json.lock
**/.shepherd/temp/

!**/.artifacts/**/.gitkeep
!**/.artifacts/models/

!.shepherd/.gitkeep
!**/.shepherd/models/

