# ----- [EXCLUSIONS] -----
!**/.gitkeep

!**/src/**/build
!**/src/**/cache
!**/src/**/config
!**/src/**/data
!**/src/**/tmp

# ----- [TRACKED-JUNK CLASSES] -----
# Enforced mechanically by .shepherd/scripts/check-tracked-junk.sh. A rule alone
# cannot hold this line: .shepherd/runs/v039-dev2/events/hooks-2026-08-25.jsonl
# was ALREADY covered by `runs/**` and still reached 2.8 MB in the index,
# because gitignore does not apply to a path that is already tracked and
# `git check-ignore` stays silent about tracked paths unless you pass
# --no-index. The gate compares the index against the rules directly.
.fuse_hidden*
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.techdebt-draft
**/events/*.jsonl
